  "remarks": "LLC “KB LIS”, also known as the “Hydrangea” Design Bureau, is a Russian UAV manufacturer. Its main products are the “Hydrangea” FPV combat drones – Hydrangea-7 and Hydrangea-10, which have been widely deployed by Russian forces in Ukraine since 2022. These systems are mass-produced at a capacity of up to 3 000 units per month.",
